  "ingredients": [
    "2 pounds baking potatoes, peeled and quartered",
    "3 cloves garlic, peeled, or to taste",
    "1 cup milk",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NuLl-yDpbDqY8RrlmwQUdC7xFDc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-24771-basic-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-137-4x3-step-01-1-8fce3754e4a5400083aaa8052bcb4f53.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24771/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add potatoes and garlic, lower heat to medium, and simmer until potatoes are tender, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/khdPE2huI--5ybgCOZ7l2yJT54I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-24771-basic-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-139-4x3-step-02-1-5bbe0ae699be4809ada0ae26994f17a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24771/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the potatoes are almost finished, heat milk and butter in a small saucepan over low heat until butter is melted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DfjvYvjbb8ATGFlro6I8bRiOH_I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-24771-basic-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-142-4x3-step-04-1-30be0073a6e443e4abebbd5b211c77fb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24771/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain potatoes and return to the pot. Slowly add warm milk mixture, blending it in with a potato masher or electric mixer until potatoes are smooth and creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rchUSdMAiRVVseZKorjU5ksdkk4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-24771-basic-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-144-4x3-step-06-1-42a7cdbe3923405a81e5cbc22d0869d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24771/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with salt and pepper. Serve topped with extra butter and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8pkbFP258H24axyBlRbGtWS-Vnk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24771-basic-mashed-potatoes-mfs318-ed832ab37551471cba0997410217d4c5.jpg"
